## Safety

The display receives rendered fields only. The token and the secret stay in `secrets/`.

Canonical file: [`docs/infrastructure/safety.md`](../../docs/infrastructure/safety.md) (D4, D8, D9).

Bind the host to the LAN. Do not add a login, a new Google scope, a port forward, or a public URL without a new decision.
